{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"相对对偶层"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“相对对偶层”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>命题</strong>.</p>\n<p>(Artan 讲的)</p>\n<p>设 $X \\overset{f}{\\to} Y \\overset{g}{\\to} Z$ 是局部 Noether 概形之间的映射, 使得 $f,g,gf$ 每个映射光滑或为局部完全相交 (local complete intersection), 则\n$$\r\n\\omega_{X/Z} \\overset{\\simeq}{\\to} f^*\\omega_{Y/Z}\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>相关概念</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Poincaré--Verdier对偶","text":"Poincaré–Verdier 对偶"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对偶对象","text":"对偶对象"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}